eal para la toma de decisiones operativas y directivas.", "short_description": "AVCXR es una plataforma inmersiva de realidad mixta enfocada en revolucionar la capacitaci\u00f3n pr\u00e1ctica en los sectores de Educaci\u00f3n, Salud e Industria.\nEl impacto principal del proyecto es la democratizaci\u00f3n y descentralizaci\u00f3n del aprendizaje: mediante el uso de laboratorios remotos y m\u00f3dulos did\u00e1cticos inmersivos, AVCXR lleva oportunidades de educaci\u00f3n superior y entrenamiento en procesos industriales directamente a zonas rurales y comunidades vulnerables de dif\u00edcil acceso"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "AVCXR_MetaQuest.png", "id": "26575577285407797", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618284_26575577292074463_8179618092863187677_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=H9hbghpGhqsQ7kNvwE-Yz4P&_nc_oc=AdphNARLdlc-rKp8VcUJVOPOHqvthPAMWTS8A_G5V4SuCm7QyknIP9l6xO6BBw0YHBo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-z4Cn7uDMBvK9gF6leanw0HIH8hscp0Ot6Blq_JR98Pg&oe=6A3D501E"}, {"file_name": "AVCXR_MetaQuest.png", "id": "3056063914782038", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499617850_3056063918115371_2202158384151631148_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=a8bX35rxTl8Q7kNvwHgLeKr&_nc_oc=AdqRBiTlclov7GnVC6dfr20UgVm0Ha06cU3rCxMjm84ZwzlJyjk4mgKB87QrPQXX4ng&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-DNeemZCv49M-mK4NIY3d5swtFllEHY0bs-HLJzyEezA&oe=6A3D27CF"}, {"file_name": "AVCXR_MetaQuest_portrait.png", "id": "2473565366496707", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499296057_2473565369830040_7720233636311648977_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mSH29pXeneAQ7kNvwE0HH73&_nc_oc=Adq0nHXxRoBCFUzsz_Cdw_Ys4fSEp3-yYmqQX42ao3CgCCLw-q74ohphj7IBUBUsCl8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscd